# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ChromaDB
# NOTE: chroma_db/ IS tracked via Git LFS (see .gitattributes)
#   chroma.sqlite3, *.bin, *.pickle → pushed to LFS on commit
#   DO NOT add "chroma_db/" or "*.bin" blanket rules here —
#   they would silently block re-adding LFS-tracked files.
# Only ignore the data/ subdirectory copy (not used in prod)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
data/chroma_db/
chroma_db/*.json
chroma_db/.*checkpoint*.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Runtime / analytics data (no deployment value)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
query_log.jsonl
tests/eval_results.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal planning / scratch docs
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
implementation_plan.md
COMMANDS.md
project_summary.md
verify_app.py

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Screenshots (root level only — avoid *.png globally)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
Screenshot*.png

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unused / legacy code
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
streamlit_app.py
